Buffer

Producer and consumer rarely work at the same speed.

So we need temporary storage.

Called:

Buffer

Example:

Producer
     ↓
 Buffer
     ↓
Consumer
Why Is Buffer Needed?

Suppose producer generates:

100 items/sec

Consumer processes:

80 items/sec

Without a buffer:

Data may be lost.

Buffer absorbs the difference.

